tests / fast (3.14)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-25T08:49:53.8244138Z -- Two-tank topology (issue #40)
tests / fast (3.14)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-25T08:49:53.8244244Z   ok   without a valve the layout is the valveless one
tests / fast (3.14)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-25T08:49:53.8244386Z   ok   a valve, two zones and a wood probe resolve to the 4-way layout
tests / fast (3.14)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-25T08:49:53.8244498Z   ok   a valve without a wood probe stays single-tank
