tests / fast (3.14)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-25T08:49:53.8245464Z   ok   the savings reference has no wood: a wood reading moves it on no layout
tests / fast (3.14)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-25T08:49:53.8245667Z   ok   the wood tank is drawn while it can meet the curve, hotter tank or not
tests / fast (3.14)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-25T08:49:53.8245896Z   ok   the blend fraction is the one the outlet estimator measures
tests / fast (3.14)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-25T08:49:53.8246106Z   ok   below the curve both tanks fall back to a smooth hotter-source switch
tests / fast (3.14)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-25T08:49:53.8246317Z   ok   sweeping the curve across both boundaries moves the draw smoothly
tests / fast (3.14)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-25T08:49:53.8246501Z   ok   and so does sweeping the wood tank up through the curve
tests / fast (3.14)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-25T08:49:53.8246735Z   ok   wood_share is continuous as wood_temp crosses the flow curve in region 3
