tests / fast (3.14)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-25T08:49:53.8247392Z   ok   the vector wood_share path stays bitwise-identical to the scalar law
tests / fast (3.14)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-25T08:49:53.8247613Z   ok   a burn charges the wood tank, pointwise
