tests / fast (3.14)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-25T08:49:53.8705871Z   ok   precondition: an indoor entity absent at the first read is missing_entity and freezes the learners
tests / fast (3.14)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-25T08:49:53.8706015Z   ok   the read that found it absent watches exactly that entity
tests / fast (3.14)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-25T08:49:53.8706140Z   ok   an entity that reappears without a value asks for nothing
tests / fast (3.14)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-25T08:49:53.8706283Z   ok   the entity reporting a value asks for one refresh at once
tests / fast (3.14)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-25T08:49:53.8706540Z   ok   that refresh re-reads it: the input is ok, the learners unfreeze, the planner's room temperature is the reading
tests / fast (3.14)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-25T08:49:53.8706676Z   ok   and with nothing absent any more nothing is watched
tests / fast (3.14)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-25T08:49:53.8706839Z   ok   a return one second short of an interval after the re-read asks for nothing
tests / fast (3.14)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-25T08:49:53.8706989Z   ok   a return exactly one interval after the re-read asks again
tests / fast (3.14)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-25T08:49:53.8707256Z   ok   precondition: a return during an in-flight cycle is asked for and dropped by the debouncer, so nothing was re-read
tests / fast (3.14)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-25T08:49:53.8707393Z   ok   the next report after a dropped request asks again
tests / fast (3.14)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-25T08:49:53.8707644Z   ok   a read after the return settles it: the next return inside the hold asks for nothing
tests / fast (3.14)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-25T08:49:53.8707833Z   ok   a returned value the guards reject is re-read and keeps the learners frozen
tests / fast (3.14)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-25T08:49:53.8708015Z   ok   an input read as unavailable is watched and re-read when it reports a value
tests / fast (3.14)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-25T08:49:53.8708192Z   ok   releasing the entry drops the watch, and a read after it registers none
tests / fast (3.14)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-25T08:49:53.8708349Z   ok   a released coordinator is collected
tests / fast (3.14)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-25T08:49:53.8708510Z   ok   null control: a read with every configured input usable watches nothing
tests / fast (3.14)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-25T08:49:53.8708679Z   ok   a present input with an unusable value (not_numeric) is not watched
tests / fast (3.14)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-25T08:49:53.8708792Z   ok   a stale input is not watched
tests / fast (3.14)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-25T08:49:53.8708951Z   ok   an unchanged watched set neither re-registers nor drops the listener
tests / fast (3.14)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-25T08:49:53.8709138Z   ok   a settled request is stamped once; a later arm does not push the spacing out
