tests / fast (3.14)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-25T08:49:53.8716484Z   ok   Cooling + DHW: space blocked=True, hot water blocked=False
tests / fast (3.14)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-25T08:49:53.8716609Z   ok   Cooling + DHW: freeze reason 'pump_cooling'
tests / fast (3.14)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-25T08:49:53.8716755Z   ok   a heating-only pump must not be promised a hot-water slot
tests / fast (3.14)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-25T08:49:53.8716875Z   ok   an unrecognised mode falls back to full capability
