tests / fast (3.14)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-25T08:49:53.8814303Z   ok   a tank that never gets hot is retried a day later, neither latching overdue nor waiting out the interval
tests / fast (3.14)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-25T08:49:53.8814473Z   ok   …and it is recorded as an attempt, not as a successful cycle
