tests / fast (3.14)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-25T08:49:53.8815725Z   ok   the overdue notice is written once per change, not on every cycle
tests / fast (3.14)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-25T08:49:53.8815979Z   ok   a window inside the retry folds into its attempt and keeps the higher peak; one at the retry's end is a fresh attempt
