tests / fast (3.14)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-25T08:49:53.8816534Z   ok   a cycle that reaches temperature clears the notices and the attempt, and restarts the countdown
tests / fast (3.14)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-25T08:49:53.8816773Z   ok   with no tank sensor a commanded cycle still resets the countdown rather than leaving it counting up for ever
tests / fast (3.14)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-25T08:49:53.8817150Z   ok   …a whole interval later, since a retry without a probe learns nothing, and the unverified notice speaks for it rather than the overdue one
