tests / fast (3.14)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-25T08:49:53.9106641Z   ok   release of the configured owned switch: unavailable waits, on writes OFF, off ends ownership without a write
tests / fast (3.14)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-25T08:49:53.9106811Z   ok   the configured owned switch, unavailable past the grace, is still waited for
tests / fast (3.14)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-25T08:49:53.9107082Z   ok   an owned switch that is no longer configured and cannot be read is kept through the grace, then dropped into lost with no write
tests / fast (3.14)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-25T08:49:53.9107221Z   ok   the grace the repair's text calls half an hour is thirty minutes
tests / fast (3.14)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-25T08:49:53.9107527Z   ok   a blind release (unload) writes OFF to every owned switch unread, and keeps only the record whose OFF failed
