tests / fast (3.14)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-25T08:49:53.9107966Z   ok   …and the ownership is in the cycle's store, where a restart reads it
tests / fast (3.14)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-25T08:49:53.9108189Z   ok   …and the boost close turns it OFF exactly once, and ownership ends when it reads off
tests / fast (3.14)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-25T08:49:53.9108474Z   ok   with the optimizer off a legionella action still current never turns the disinfection switch on (null control above: on, it does)
